<title>HONG KONG: Nam Fong share issue 165.6 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Nam Fong share issue 165.6 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nam Fong International Holdings Ltd said on Monday its issue of 340 milllon shares at HK$2.88 per share was 165.6 times subscribed.</p>
<p>Trading of the shares in Hong Kong would begin on December 9, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Net proceeds of HK$788 million would be used in investments in development projects in Guangzhou, in southern Chinese Guangdong province, it said.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
